# The Tier 1 parser, generated from grammar/step.peggy by scripts/build-grammar.mjs.
#
# Not committed, unlike the JSON Schemas and actions.yaml. Those are small and are
# read by people and by foreign runtimes; this is 300 kB of generated parser that
# nobody reads and that would swamp every diff that touches the grammar. `build`,
# `typecheck` and `test` all regenerate it first, so no command needs it present.
src/generated/*

# …except the hand-written declaration file beside it. The generated module is
# JavaScript with `@ts-nocheck` on it, and this is what gives `tier1.ts` types.
# It is not generated, and a clean checkout that lacked it could not build —
# which is exactly how this line came to be here.
!src/generated/step-parser.d.ts
